  Hypothesis DJS : bv_unsigned a1 + bv_unsigned a2 <= lo \/ bv_unsigned sp <= bv_unsigned a1.
  Hypothesis RMC : rw_cells asegs m AMEMCPYP_CELL [C8 (Z_to_bv 64 AREAL_MEMCPY)].

